        <mxCell id="card_wh" parent="lane_gateway" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1E293B;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#F8FAFC;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=11;shadow=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#38bdf8&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot;&gt;FastAPI Webhook Receiver&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;backend/api/webhooks.py&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Validates &lt;b&gt;X-Hub-Signature-256&lt;/b&gt; (HMAC)&lt;br&gt;• Extracts repo, PR #, base/head commit&lt;br&gt;• Enforces Singleton Watched Repo filter&lt;br&gt;• Spawns non-blocking async FSM task&lt;br&gt;• Returns HTTP 202 Accepted in &lt; 100ms" vertex="1">
